UID:wcc-2026-d1@claude-chess-cal
DTSTAMP:20260728T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261124
SUMMARY:♟ World Chess Championship - Match begins
DESCRIPTION:World Chess Championship 2026 - Gukesh v Sindarov\nMatch begi
 ns\nMonday 23 November 2026\n\nMatch window: Mon 23 Nov - Thu 17 Dec 202
 6\nHost city: TO BE CONFIRMED\n\nNotes\nFIDE World Chess Championship 20
 26\nGukesh Dommaraju (India\, defending champion) v Javokhir Sindarov (U
 zbekistan\, challenger).\n\nThe youngest world championship match in his
 tory - both players are 20. Sindarov won the 2026 Candidates in Cyprus w
 ith 10/14\, unbeaten\, clinching it with a round to spare. He is also th
 e youngest ever World Cup winner.\n\nMinimum prize fund USD 2.5 million\
 ; total event budget around USD 8.5 million.\n\nTWO THINGS UNCONFIRMED:\
 n1. HOST CITY. FIDE opened bidding with a deadline of 31 May 2026 and ha
 d not announced a winner at the time this calendar was built. India and 
 Uzbekistan are the obvious candidates\; Sindarov has said he would prefe
 r somewhere warm\, like Cyprus.\n2. GAME SCHEDULE. Which days are games 
 and which are rest days has not been published\, so this is the full 25-
 day window.
CATEGORIES:Chess,World Championship
URL:https://www.fide.com/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
